  "description": "A type of internet meme that uses visual imagery of a specific racial or ethnic group combined with text that perpetuates harmful stereotypes. These memes are designed to spread misinformation and reinforce prejudice. The current meme is a classic example, using the visual of Maasai men to spread a false and hateful claim about their intelligence.",
